-- `&&` inside a helper applied to a draw-bound record is refused, while the
-- `if` spelling compiles. The list-element shape over separate draws
-- (let-bindings/andInsideListOverDraws) was fixed by draw sinking past a
-- literal sibling; this one remains. Task and-inside-list-or-helper-over-draws-refused.
data R = R l::Bool, r::Bool
both h = (l h) && (r h)
main = draw h = R (Uniform < 0.3) (Uniform < 0.6) in [both h]
